• `cargo test 5678 passed / 0 failed; cargo test --locked --features gasp` 5699 passed / 0 failed.
• **Positive control run serially as one atomic mutate→run→restore, mutation marked `NEUTERED` so `tests/neutered_guards.rs` enforced the restore: neutering `no_op` reddened exactly** the new test by name (`expected exactly one task.status_changed for task_run_gasp_noop_1 … left: 0, right: 1`) while the near-miss stayed green. Restored, grep NEUTERED src/ is empty, diff green.

